  "query_preview": "..\n(Saturday through next Wednesday)\nIssued at 1244 PM CDT Thu Jul 23 2026\n\nHigh pressure will continue to dominate with high temperatures \nreaching into the triple digits. Pretty much through the extended \nperiod. The one caveat will be Saturday where some locations may be \nheld back near 99 for a high. This will be highly contingent on the \namount of rain that can be realized on Friday, as soil moisture \ncould locally hold back some isolated areas from full potential \nheating. The extended period is looking dry outside of maybe \nCimarron getting clipped by some ridge riders. Each day will have to \nbe looked at closely for potential of may a 10 PoP at most, but it \nis too far out to tell at this time for subtle details is moisture \nand convective temperatures attempting to pop an isolated shower or \ntwo.",
